<title>USA: Federal Agricultural Q4 net decreases.</title>
<headline>Federal Agricultural Q4 net decreases.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p>Class A and B</p>
<p>    shr			 nil   profit    $  0.02b</p>
