<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income for 1996 includes an extraordinary gain on early retirement of debt of $384,000.</p>
<p>Primary earnings per share have been restated to reflect the class C common stock 3-to-1 dividend and liquidation preference compared to classes A and B common stock.</p>
<p>The provision for loan losses for fiscal year 1996 is $262,000, as compared to $96,000 for fiscal 1995.  The provision for loan losses for the fourth quarter of 1996 is $61,000, as compared to $23,000 for the fourth quarter of 1995.</p>
<p>Federal Agricultural Mortgage Corp.</p>
